# TKT-20260302-114

[In triage](#status), assigned to [D. Chen](#assignee). Working
[hypothesis](#hypothesis) from the diagnostics
([diagnostics/env-report.md](diagnostics/env-report.md),
[app.log](diagnostics/app.log), [screenshot.png](diagnostics/screenshot.png),
full [support-bundle.tar.gz](diagnostics/support-bundle.tar.gz)): the spooler
has leaked memory since Friday's 2.14 patch and the queue only drains between
GC pauses — which also explains the duplicates (client retries).
